#!/bin/sh
# probes/corpus/28-class-ports-acceptance.run -- the Step-10 acceptance
# figures of the class 8/5/7/4 ports, read from the committed records (no
# Maxima), plus the unloaded-file listing of each section.
#
#   sh probes/corpus/28-class-ports-acceptance.run
cd "$(dirname "$0")/../.." || exit 1
OUT=probes/corpus/28-class-ports-acceptance.out
{
  echo "date: $(date -u '+%F %H:%M UTC')  commit: $(git rev-parse --short HEAD)"
  echo
  echo "== rule files in the pinned tree that Rubi.m does not load"
  for s in "8 " "5 " "7 " "4 "; do
    python3 probes/translation/11-class7-excluded-files.py "$s"
  done
  python3 probes/corpus/28-class-ports-acceptance.py 8 5 7 4
} > "$OUT" 2>&1
echo "wrote $OUT"
